N2  - The use of herbal medicines and neutraceuticals is on the rise. This brief review provides a primer of the common herbal medicines that influence patient management in the perioperative period of ocular surgery. It is not intended to be a comprehensive review of this topic, but rather, aims to aid practicing ophthalmologists and anesthesiologists to better understand the influence of these agents on patient care.
